{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clutchtime</strong> is a deck builder centered around <strong>basketball plays</strong> and <strong>team synergies</strong>. The <strong>Tournament Edition</strong> brings you 6 difficulty levels which you unlock one by one by winning all games in a single-elimination tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/7ec04cbcab4dc2f22def8f219b5e5c79.avif?t=1750382909\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each team has a starting deck of 5 players with 3 cards representing their skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/ac4e9700312c02bd58418610ce8c867f.avif?t=1750382909\" width=616 height=326 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can upgrade, trade and remove those cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/2a2e90dae87f842aa36583136d7b09a1.avif?t=1750382909\" width=616 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each quarter, you get to pick new cards to add for this game. At the end of the match, you can keep one of those cards in your deck until the end of the tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/169ef31809205997d6dd11cb25b5f010.avif?t=1750382909\" width=616 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique game mechanics allows you to try different cards and builds while playing the match without having to commit to it for the rest of the tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/6d63699eba5365b33d0c8ff54c3778a4.avif?t=1750382909\" width=616 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become a champion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573920?t=1750382909","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573920?t=1750382909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/79ca750b5ceb52846d8dd616aa09a6eddb896933/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750382909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/79ca750b5ceb52846d8dd616aa09a6eddb896933/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750382909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Main Game</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/93cf4a622d8e221842529bb82b505be4.avif?t=1750382909\" width=616 height=174 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clutchtime</strong> is a deck builder centered around <strong>basketball plays</strong> and <strong>team synergies</strong>. The <strong>Tournament Edition</strong> brings you 6 difficulty levels which you unlock one by one by winning all games in a single-elimination tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/7ec04cbcab4dc2f22def8f219b5e5c79.avif?t=1750382909\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each team has a starting deck of 5 players with 3 cards representing their skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/ac4e9700312c02bd58418610ce8c867f.avif?t=1750382909\" width=616 height=326 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can upgrade, trade and remove those cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/2a2e90dae87f842aa36583136d7b09a1.avif?t=1750382909\" width=616 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each quarter, you get to pick new cards to add for this game. At the end of the match, you can keep one of those cards in your deck until the end of the tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/169ef31809205997d6dd11cb25b5f010.avif?t=1750382909\" width=616 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique game mechanics allows you to try different cards and builds while playing the match without having to commit to it for the rest of the tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/extras/6d63699eba5365b33d0c8ff54c3778a4.avif?t=1750382909\" width=616 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become a champion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Bigosaur"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573920/e16601d23544f595d5ce67089688458eff315687/header.jpg?t=1750382909","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3573920/844494/a6f109ce908642dfb5ae53bc4603f331c147fb92/1750469382/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741610585","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3573920/844494/a6f109ce908642dfb5ae53bc4603f331c147fb92/1750469382/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741610585","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3573920/844494/a6f109ce908642dfb5ae53bc4603f331c147fb92/1750469382/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1741610585","id":257109905,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109905/movie480.mp4?t=1741610585","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109905/movie_max.mp4?t=1741610585"},"name":"Launch trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257109905/fbe61ad071b8e89c3d69f7295cde213d314f44aa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741610585","webm":{"480":"htt